Package: glyrex
Title: Regular Expressions for Glycan Structures
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bin", "Fu", , "23110220018@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compile and match glycan structural regular expressions with
    a stringr-like interface. Supports residue classes, linkage constraints,
    branches, repetition, assertions, and named captures on glyrepr graphs,
    including explicit reducing-end anomeric information.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    glyparse (>= 0.8.1),
    glyrepr (>= 1.1.0),
    igraph,
    utils
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://glycoverse.github.io/glyrex/
